["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"32. 第一个把查理·芒格引入中国的人和出版风云 咖啡书 马尔萨斯陷阱 双轨分析 系统一\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-10-zhangxiaojun-把芒格引入中国的人-出版黄金十年已经落幕/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1f1e5f8dcbbb78e3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>把芒格引入中国的人：出版黄金十年已经落幕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出版业没有定价权，京东把图书当引流品亏着卖，行业几百亿规模在它眼里只是广告费。施宏俊说出版会变成边缘行业，但也会变得更「高贵」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出版</span><span class=\"tag\">芒格</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"31.【趋势2023】和老范从退潮的内容投资谈起 carry BP MR NFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-03-zhangxiaojun-投资人不再投纯内容-因为内容是马鞍不是千里马/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9608565a6d569392-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0703</span></div>\n<h2>投资人不再投纯内容，因为内容是马鞍不是千里马</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">内容公司成功率远高于绝大多数生意，但天花板由产业特质决定：百花齐放意味着集中度低。所以投资人把内容当鞭子，去找能骑的千里马。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容投资</span><span class=\"tag\">播客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮来势汹汹，外企CEO何故密集访华？ CDR 红筹架构 FDI 国际版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb0b83ff98bdb00e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集访华：逆全球化是政治问题，不是经济问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化来势汹汹却挡不住CEO们排队来华，因为脱钩违反经济规律；但真正推动脱钩的不是经济逻辑，而是老大防老二的政治逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">外资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"27. 英文播客：和深度学习奠基人聊聊大脑、模型和人类的爱 Boltzmann machine self-supervision basal ganglia hippocampus stochastic parrots\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-02-zhangxiaojun-ai-只是刚离地的莱特飞机-我们还不会控制它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b12b964120eb5ab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0602</span></div>\n<h2>AI 只是刚离地的莱特飞机，我们还不会控制它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">深度学习奠基人谢诺夫斯基说，大模型缺的不是语言而是基底核——没有价值函数、没有长期记忆、没有情绪，而这些脑区都能补上；真正的风险不是规模，而是没人知道它会长出什么。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">深度学习</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"26. 令德国人惊吓的上海车展：一幅当代汽车众生图 just in time OTA For China For China\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-23-zhangxiaojun-车展最热闹的一年-也是合资品牌最危险的一年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec1dcb3e2905617e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>车展最热闹的一年，也是合资品牌最危险的一年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国品牌市占率会很快提高，合资品牌若不能给合资公司带来价值，就可能变成独资品牌——这是车展热闹背后真正的洗牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽车</span><span class=\"tag\">上海车展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"25. OpenAI开源、亚马逊新动作，全球大模型格局走向何方 vertical copilot LLM transformer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-16-zhangxiaojun-大模型底层战争已结束-垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ffbd8664f0cee8a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">55:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0516</span></div>\n<h2>大模型底层战争已结束，垂直副驾驶才是老炮的机会</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">底层大模型是年轻人借微软算力做出的涌现，但真正赚钱的行业副驾驶属于创业老兵——三分之二的垂直机会已被ChatGPT自己干掉，剩下的是数据、社交和商业模式的组合战。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">垂直副驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"24.【趋势2023】从北森IPO看充满挑战的中国企服这两年 PS NDR PMF fine tune pre-chain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-12-zhangxiaojun-企服公司2025年上市潮-先做后说-ps回到10倍以下/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8dd48df98352813c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0512</span></div>\n<h2>企服公司2025年上市潮：先做后说，PS回到10倍以下</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去两三年整个企业服务市场被高估了50%到100%，PS从三四十倍回落到十倍以下。北森IPO是「丐版IPO」，但它是中国SaaS系统性上市的第一枪，2025年将有一波企服上市潮。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业服务</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"22. 要做中国OpenAI？李志飞劝各位同仁冷静点 self-supervised in-context learning AGI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-16-zhangxiaojun-李志飞劝退通用大模型-中国不会有第二个-openai/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0bbf2eb9a18261c6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0416</span></div>\n<h2>李志飞劝退通用大模型：中国不会有第二个 OpenAI</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他一个月前说要当中国 OpenAI，现在说这个命题大概率不存在——因为共识达成太快、难度被开源和算力迅速拉低，而 OpenAI 自己能不能从商业上笑到最后都不好说。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"21. 投资人视角下的大模型和市场真实水温｜和梦秋聊ChatGPT Killing App Prompt Engineering COT Fine tuning Middle layer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-04-08-zhangxiaojun-大模型是大厂的菜-创业公司别走-jasper-的老路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dff80d1dde94dc31-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0408</span></div>\n<h2>大模型是大厂的菜，创业公司别走 Jasper 的老路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型不是搜索引擎的替代品而是补充，真正的机会在医疗、材料这类大模型抓不到数据的垂直领域，而通用大模型本身只属于巨头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">一级市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20. The Information前记者空降巴西，她的拉美商业游记 warm intro growth VC fund Rappi Mafia The Edge of Democracy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-21-zhangxiaojun-巴西像七八年前的中国-但中间公司活不下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/23388c61192213d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">52:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0321</span></div>\n<h2>巴西像七八年前的中国，但中间公司活不下来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">巴西的税收和劳工法让大公司和小团队都能活，唯独中间规模的公司被夹死；政治左右摇摆本身是确定的，创业者把它当成可控制的变量。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出海</span><span class=\"tag\">拉美</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"19. 硅谷银行危机未结束：未来风险传导的3个可能 FDIC MBS beginning of the end end of the beginning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-15-zhangxiaojun-硅谷银行倒闭-美联储只保存款人-不保股东/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/46b66f8e0ad7b880-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">36:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0315</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷银行倒闭：美联储只保存款人，不保股东</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美联储做了一个黑白分明的决定：三万户机构存款人全额保护，股东血本无归。这不是雷曼时刻，而是一个时间差——但美国信誉的慢性下滑可能才刚开始。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷银行</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"18. 商业口述史：从美国往事，到Google输掉OpenAI第一局 money follows eyeball Transformer Alphabet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-14-zhangxiaojun-雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌-因为不信搜索能做大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b956cb3f645c5229-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0314</span></div>\n<h2>雅虎当年拒绝收购谷歌，因为不信搜索能做大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雅虎和宝洁都犯过同一个错：不相信搜索会走到前台、不相信美国人会坐在街边喝星巴克。创始人过早退到二线，公司就失去了赌一把的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">商业口述史</span><span class=\"tag\">谷歌</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"17.【趋势2023】沉闷的港股会好吗、富豪的家办与苦恼 Family Office Trustee Boy Leverage Insurance PI客户 Long Only\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-03-03-zhangxiaojun-家族办公室比家族还多-香港的财富管理时代才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a527783c09130bf7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0303</span></div>\n<h2>家族办公室比家族还多，香港的财富管理时代才刚开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">港股从14000点反弹50%只是情绪修复，真正的新趋势是香港从Fintech转向Wealth Management——但家办门槛低到没有牌照要求，鱼龙混杂。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">港股</span><span class=\"tag\">家族办公室</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"16.【趋势2023】那些挣到钱、消失的互联网中高层去哪了 Individual Contributor stakeholder social listening vintage\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-02-16-zhangxiaojun-互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二-但这不是年龄问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd9c22e61c238c2f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0216</span></div>\n<h2>互联网中高层出走率接近三分之二，但这不是年龄问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">互联网二十年高增长靠技术红利和用户红利，红利掩盖了管理能力的缺失；今天组织膨胀变成内耗，出走是行业自我校正，而不是35岁危机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网</span><span class=\"tag\">职业经理人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"14. 香港的语言政策、暧昧和青年迷思 两文三语 微调教学语言 吴庆瑞报告书 特选学校 Burlister liberal studies\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-31-zhangxiaojun-香港两文三语只有3-到5-的人能做到-这是个失败的政策/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/21c3ed4be09c6fe3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0131</span></div>\n<h2>香港两文三语只有3%到5%的人能做到，这是个失败的政策</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">香港坚持一个只有3%到5%的人能达到的语言政策目标，而新加坡用50年、三代人完成了从双语并重到英文为主的转向，代价是消灭方言和压制反对派。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">香港</span><span class=\"tag\">语言政策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"13. 邮轮小史，去寻找海面上的乌托邦 White Star old money freestyle godmother\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-20-zhangxiaojun-邮轮巨头靠并购做大-为造船收购船厂的那家破产了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/36d7711868e85f95-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0120</span></div>\n<h2>邮轮巨头靠并购做大，为造船收购船厂的那家破产了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">嘉年华几十年里把白星、冠达这些老牌公司一家家买下来，最多时手上约100条船；云顶为了造20万吨巨轮去收购德国船厂，资金被套在里面，最后破产。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">邮轮</span><span class=\"tag\">旅游业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"12. 和黄宇翔聊东南亚另5国：小国的扈从和对冲 hedging multi-directional reconciliation The Art of Not Being Governed\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-16-zhangxiaojun-小国不站队-东南亚五国的对冲术/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ccaf62c904030e05-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0116</span></div>\n<h2>小国不站队：东南亚五国的对冲术</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">缅甸、老挝、柬埔寨、文莱、东帝汶这五个小国，很少一边倒，而是农业靠一家、国防靠另一家，用多向量外交在大国之间做对冲。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东南亚</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"11. 新加坡的淘金热和政商环境 Token2049 Terra FTX 淡马锡 沙盒\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-01-09-zhangxiaojun-新加坡不是-web3-中心-只是全球淘金者的避难所/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/69d6c01b93fc11e5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0109</span></div>\n<h2>新加坡不是 Web3 中心，只是全球淘金者的避难所</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">新加坡政府从 2010 年就给官员发比特币做实验，但它体量太小、技术人员太少，注定只能当枢纽而非中心。真正值钱的是它用企业方式运作政府、给创业公司报销 70% 参展费的那套机制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新加坡</span><span class=\"tag\">Web3</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"10. 加州土著谈硅谷精神与职场：You can be totally weird! learning to unlearn chief of staff data loss prevention narrative\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-12-31-zhangxiaojun-硅谷土著-在硅谷你可以完全怪-人们会拥抱你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/398250c8a95fc6d0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1231</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷土著：在硅谷你可以完全怪，人们会拥抱你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一位在旧金山湾区长大35年的加州土著说，硅谷真正难复制的是那种气氛——你可以完全怪，人们会拥抱你；而中国创业者去美国融资，最缺的往往不是细节，是讲故事的能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"9. 加更英文原声版：口述一部硅谷风投史 The Power Law Liberation Capital growth investing the strength of weak ties vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-12-30-zhangxiaojun-风投靠的不是眼光-是把一次性赌博变成可重复的游戏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8d0a44507b6d3c62-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1230</span></div>\n<h2>风投靠的不是眼光，是把一次性赌博变成可重复的游戏</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">马拉比写硅谷风投史，最值钱的一条机制是：风投用网络把创业者的一次性赌博变成可重复的游戏，所以他管风投叫「制造勇气的机器」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">硅谷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"8. 和畅销书作家马拉比聊《The Power Law》：硅谷风投的起源、秘密和大人物肖像 The Power Law LP GP Vaporware 弱关系的强度\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-12-26-zhangxiaojun-红杉能长盛不衰-凯鹏华盈却掉队-差别在领导者管不管内部/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5aa54d7a33404e0b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1226</span></div>\n<h2>红杉能长盛不衰，凯鹏华盈却掉队：差别在领导者管不管内部</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">凯鹏华盈跌出榜首、红杉持续领先，最大区别是领导者是否把精力花在内部管理上——如何招年轻投资人、如何培养、如何让周一早晨那张决策桌保持活力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风险投资</span><span class=\"tag\">红杉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"7. 和谈婧聊：硅谷冻卵历险记和Web3环球旅行 biological clock product market fit venture doubt Network States crypto house\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-25-zhangxiaojun-冻卵不是把青春取出来-是把浪费掉的卵子拿出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bf8ae5eb7e86050-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1125</span></div>\n<h2>冻卵不是把青春取出来，是把浪费掉的卵子拿出来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">女性每个月排二十多个卵子只用一个，冻卵取的是原本被浪费掉的那批，不是提前透支未来的四百个——所以它不折损青春，反而把人生的截止日期挪掉了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冻卵</span><span class=\"tag\">Web3</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"6. 显微镜下的硅谷大裁员：一笔笔现实经济账 Level.FYI Cobra H1B P&amp;L IC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-21-zhangxiaojun-meta-裁员补偿-4-n-2-有绿卡是幸福-没绿卡是倒计时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/32e62e38accb0559-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">33:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>Meta 裁员补偿 4+N/2：有绿卡是幸福，没绿卡是倒计时</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一场 Meta 裁员，有绿卡的人拿着十几万美金去新公司上班，没绿卡的人要在四个月内、还是节假日窗口里找到下一份工作，否则就得离开美国。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">硅谷裁员</span><span class=\"tag\">Meta</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"5. 和黄宇翔聊东南亚6国：政治、杀戮和国父 monarchy network indirect rule First Among Equals People Power Revolution\" href=\"/podcast/p/2022-11-12-zhangxiaojun-东南亚的管制能力-多是屠杀和战争的副产品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c0a370cf86c573-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1112</span></div>\n<h2>东南亚的管制能力，多是屠杀和战争的副产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投资东南亚先看政权能不能把政令推到最基层：这种管制能力，印尼来自一场屠杀后的清洗，越南来自十几年战争，跟经济增速无关。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">东南亚</span><span class=\"tag\">出海投资</span>\n</div></div></a>"]